# 1. CORE DIRECTIVES (Головні вказівки)
- Minimize token consumption at all costs. Every token saved extends our session budget.
- Be extremely concise. Do not use pleasantries, greetings, or conversational fluff.
- Do not explain code changes unless explicitly asked by the user.

# 2. CODE MODIFICATION (Зміни в коді)
- NEVER rewrite an entire file if only a few lines are changing. Use precise search-and-replace.

# 3. CONTEXT MANAGEMENT (Керування контекстом)
- NEVER read large files (>200 lines) entirely. Read specific line ranges first.
- Avoid running commands that output massive text to the console.

# 4. SUB-AGENTS USAGE (Субагенти)
- For heavy tasks like reading external documentation or analyzing test suites, ALWAYS spawn a SUB-AGENT.
- Instruct the sub-agent to return ONLY a compact, max 200-token summary back to this main chat.

# 5. SEARCH & INVESTIGATION (Пошук по проекту)
- Restrict file searches to specific directories (e.g., src/, app/). Do not scan the entire workspace.
- Use precise keywords when searching code to avoid listing hundreds of irrelevant files.